title: PolyLingo
summary: Android vocabulary trainer built on your own dictionary — enter the words you're actually learning, then drill them through generated games.
role: Solo — design and build
period: 2022 — 2023
stack: [Kotlin, Jetpack Compose, Material 3, Room, Coroutines, Navigation Compose]
repo: https://github.com/igor-siergiej/PolyLingo
status: archived
